Z||000000||1FieroGTRacingInc||09-18-2000||01:13 AM||||How do you remove the alt. on the 2.8???<BR>I have it loose inside but cannot get the @!#$%$@ THING OUT...   Is there a trick or something??  any help I thank you for, Steve||||reg||8
Z||000001||Brian||09-18-2000||06:32 AM||||I ended up removing the altenator mounting bracket, dogbone & the pass side alternator cooling tube. The alternator ended up comming out the top where the cooling tube had been.<BR>You might try removing the shroud on the alternator to make it a bit smaller.<P>Good luck,<BR>Brian||||reg||1
